OL,3,AZelensky accuses Russia of striking
OL,4,Apower plant after Trump's claim of
OL,5,Aenergy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says Ukraine and Russia
OL,8,Fhave agreed to an immediate "energy
OL,9,Fceasefire", without providing details
OL,10,Fof its terms - here's what we know
OL,12,FUkraine's Volodymyr Zelensky says he
OL,13,Fsupports the ceasefire, adding "it is
OL,14,Fimportant that Russia support it as
OL,15,Fwell"; Moscow is yet to comment
OL,17,FBut Zelensky has since accused Russia
OL,18,Fof striking energy facilities after
OL,19,FTrump claimed a deal had been done
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
