OL,3,AZelensky accuses Russia of striking
OL,4,Apower plant after Trump's claim of
OL,5,Aenergy ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficials say several people have also
OL,8,Fdied in separate attacks across
OL,9,FUkraine, including a strike on a
OL,10,FKharkiv grocery store that killed three
OL,12,FEarlier, Zelensky condemned Trump's
OL,13,Fdeal to import Russian diesel into the
OL,14,FUS, calling it a "gift" to President
OL,15,FPutin
OL,17,FIn return, Trump - who is under
OL,18,Fpressure to bring down fuel prices -
OL,19,Fhit back that it was "time for Ukraine
OL,20,Fto get a new president" - watch it here
